        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "The DQ $7 Meal Deal includes your choice of a classic Cheeseburger or 3-Piece Chicken Strip Basket, plus Regular Fries, a 21 oz soft drink, and a Small Sundae all for $7.00."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What are the most popular Dairy Queen Blizzard flavors?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "The top-selling DQ Blizzard flavors are Oreo Cookie, Chocolate Chip Cookie Dough, Reese's Peanut Butter Cup, M&M's, Turtle Pecan Cluster, and Brownie Batter."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Does Dairy Queen serve breakfast?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Yes, select DQ Grill & Chill locations serve breakfast daily until 10:30 AM, featuring biscuit & gravy, pancakes, hash brown scrambles, and breakfast burritos."
      }
    }
