      <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">What is on the Dairy Queen $7 Meal Deal?<span class="faq-icon">+</span></button><div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">The <a href="/items/7-meal-deal">DQ $7 Meal Deal</a> includes your choice of a Cheeseburger or 3-Piece Chicken Strip Basket, plus Regular Fries, a Soft Drink, and a Small Sundae — all for $7.00. Available all day at participating DQ Grill &amp; Chill locations.</div></div></div>
      <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">What are the most popular Dairy Queen Blizzard flavors?<span class="faq-icon">+</span></button><div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">The top DQ Blizzard flavors: <strong>Oreo® Cookie</strong> (#1 year-round), <strong>Chocolate Chip Cookie Dough</strong>, <strong>Reese's® Peanut Butter Cup</strong>, <strong>M&amp;M's®</strong>, <strong>Turtle Pecan Cluster</strong>, and <strong>Brownie Batter</strong>. Summer 2026 seasonals include Dipped Strawberry Cheesecake and S'mores.</div></div></div>
